  "description": "Cross-Sensor Masked Autoencoders (CSMAEs) are adaptations of vanilla Masked Autoencoders (MAEs) for sensor-agnostic and cross-modal content-based image retrieval (CBIR) in remote sensing. CSMAEs introduce architectural and training modifications to enable learning from multi-sensor (e.g., SAR and multispectral) image pairs, supporting both uni-modal and cross-modal retrieval.",
